      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Oil system drains",
      "text": "A drain or drains must be provided to allow safe drainage of the oil system. Each drain must \u2013\n(a) Be accessible;\n(b) Have drain valves, or other closures, employing manual or automatic shut-off means for positive locking in the closed position; and\n(c) Be located or protected to prevent inadvertent operation.",
